        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 87001, Freestone Thru-Bolt Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Freestone Door Handle is a great choice for modern decors. Its sleek and clean design pairs beautifully with the available contemporary finishes. Choose from 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths for your wood, metal, and fiberglass interior and exterior doors. This Freestone Door Pull comes packaged with everything you'll need to mount it on doors up to 1-3/4 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/freestone-back-to-back-handle-pair-emtek-btb-87001\"><b> Freestone Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Freestone Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-87001-specifications.pdf?v=1704262368\"><b>Emtek Freestone Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-87001:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 11/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-87002:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 11/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.<i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
